BT /F1 10 Tf 65 490 Td (1. Divergence between Operating Cash Flow \(CFO\) and Reported PAT.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 65 475 Td (2. Frequent changes in Statutory Auditors or qualified audit notes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 65 460 Td (3. High Related Party Transactions \(RPT\) with promoter shell entities.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 65 445 Td (4. Excessive capitalization of R&D / software expenses on balance sheet.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 65 430 Td (5. Pledged promoter shareholding exceeding 15% of promoter stake.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 65 415 Td (6. Days Sales Outstanding \(DSO\) spiking faster than revenue growth.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 65 400 Td (7. Unexplained CWIP \(Capital Work In Progress\) lingering over 3+ years.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12 Tf 50 365 Td (3. Intrinsic Valuation Formulas) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 65 345 Td (ROCE = EBIT / \(Total Assets - Current Liabilities\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 65 330 Td (FCFF = CFO - Capex + Interest*\(1 - Tax Rate\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 65 315 Td (Enterprise Value \(EV\) = Market Capitalization + Total Debt - Cash & Cash Eq.) Tj ET
